/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/25/0534812/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/25/0534812/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/25/0534812/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/25/0534812/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影をしてもらった日に、お母さんに電話で...\n「多分、お母さん見たらビックリするかも」って言っておいたの！(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ感想は聞いてないんだけどね 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやってこんな表情してるんだ〜って思った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/25/0534812/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆はどうですか？\n感想待ってます(//∇//)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/25/0534812/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇねぇ〜たまにさぁすっごいクシャミの人いない？(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ハクション』\nのあとに\n『オラ〜』ってつけたり......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/25/0534812/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ハクション』じゃなくて\n『ハクシュ〜(拍手)』\nって聞こえたり。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁなんでこんなはなしをしたかと言うと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂では\n川後陽菜ちゃん橋本奈々未ちゃん\nのクシャミが特徴的で２人共スッゴク何回もクシャミするの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/25/0534812/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも川後ちゃんはリアルに\n『シュッシュッシュッシュッ』って耳をすまして聞くくらい小さいクシャミをするの！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんは本人いわくクシャミらしんだけど咳みたいなの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから思わずまあやはalways"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『 今のクシャミ？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思わず聞いちゃうもん！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２人共可愛いくしゃみなんだよ♪(^w^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆は自分のクシャミ変わってるなって思ったことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/25/0534812/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月お誕生日の方〜(^o^)おめでとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★西野七瀬ちゃん★\nなあちゃ〜ん♪(^o^)\n女の子らしい仕草が可愛い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/25/0534812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鳥が好きだけどヒヨコが苦手らしい.........笑\nまた焼き肉行こうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/25/0534812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★伊藤かりんちゃん♪\n２期生の中で１番早くに仲良くしてくれて、優しくて可愛いかりんちゃんです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な１年になりますように(*´∀｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/25/0534812/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"}